# Wave T55 (Wildreach kit): adoberoof — SUN-BAKED ADOBE SLABS: large flat khaki-tan clay slabs with wide dark joints offset per band, bleached top edges and sparse cracks, in the town style's own khaki family (roof #9c905e/#6e6240/#bab086). LARGE FLAT SLABS, structurally unlike Lilac's bronzroof (small overlapping shingle courses), Fairhaven's canvasroof (stitched canvas), Fenland's boardroof (vertical timber boards), Clashfield's basaltroof (basalt-red shingles). Worn by the House + both facade cottages. (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T55-WILDREACH-PLAN.md §5.)
